sequenceDiagram
  participant MCP as gradguard-core-mcp
  participant API as Core API /v2

  MCP->>API: GET /sanctum/csrf-cookie
  API-->>MCP: Set-Cookie XSRF-TOKEN, api_v2
  MCP->>API: POST /login + X-XSRF-TOKEN
  API-->>MCP: agent id, requires_mfa
  alt MFA required
    MCP->>API: GET /mfa/sms or /mfa/email
    Note over MCP: Human calls core_submit_mfa
    MCP->>API: POST /mfa { code }
  end
  MCP->>API: POST /graphql/agent
  API-->>MCP: data (permission-checked)
